      *> </Metadata>
      *>
      *> <Synopsis>
      *> Minimal CBLLE scaffold with deterministic entry and return behavior.
      *> </Synopsis>
      *>
      *> <Revision History>
      *> Revisioner | Date | Jira No (if known) | Change |
      *> R. Strauss | 2026-08-28 | N/A | Initial scaffold |
      *> </Revision History>

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TPLCBL01.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-I.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-I.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RETURN-CODE            PIC S9(5) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-MESSAGE                PIC X(64) VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM INITIALIZE-LEG
           MOVE 'TPLCBL01 started' TO WS-MESSAGE
           DISPLAY WS-MESSAGE
           GOBACK.

       INITIALIZE-LEG.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-RETURN-CODE.

       END PROGRAM TPLCBL01.
